{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/5d02aac8b76960cc9a9c859cc596bae1.apng?t=1772330747\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/5d02aac8b76960cc9a9c859cc596bae1.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looppip has a unique power: by manipulating time, it can rewind up to 3 seconds into the past. This ability lets you escape traps, fix mistakes, and solve challenging puzzles. With the hourglass in hand, every second matters as you fight to protect the bees\u2014key players in maintaining ecological balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/de9e30b8a8785ea1ee2d4b6bccce2a59.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/de9e30b8a8785ea1ee2d4b6bccce2a59.webm?t=1772330747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/de9e30b8a8785ea1ee2d4b6bccce2a59.mp4?t=1772330747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/d58f566b91c5cbbe416824d14d4001e5.apng?t=1772330747\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/d58f566b91c5cbbe416824d14d4001e5.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Looppip, a magical seed carrying an ancient hourglass with the power to turn back time. Your mission is to save the beehives\u2014essential for life on Earth\u2014and reverse the environmental collapse threatening nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/ecaf4075087c0bb74dd85d6c3b278637.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/ecaf4075087c0bb74dd85d6c3b278637.webm?t=1772330747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/ecaf4075087c0bb74dd85d6c3b278637.mp4?t=1772330747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/67aa9e7ff24b675abc2f1d376e185018.apng?t=1772330747\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/67aa9e7ff24b675abc2f1d376e185018.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey through four worlds devastated by destructive forces, where you'll face:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First World:</strong> Wildfires consuming vital habitats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second World:</strong> Air and water pollution poisoning the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third World:</strong> Aggressive industrialization choking nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourth World:</strong> Robots and artificial intelligence ignoring ecological balance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/d7a0eec15b6b791e8cc8343e645da8b0.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/d7a0eec15b6b791e8cc8343e645da8b0.webm?t=1772330747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/d7a0eec15b6b791e8cc8343e645da8b0.mp4?t=1772330747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/bb2dd7639340312e23c5640dcf158bef.apng?t=1772330747\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/bb2dd7639340312e23c5640dcf158bef.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looppip is a seed that plants seeds. During your journey, you can rescue friendly seeds you encounter. These seeds become available in a special stage, where you can plant and grow them to unlock power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/3cbae4302d68d413bbf781fc6f51582e.gif?t=1772330747\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/3cbae4302d68d413bbf781fc6f51582e.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/be7963928d839adab19e35562478b9ce.apng?t=1772330747\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/be7963928d839adab19e35562478b9ce.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looppip is designed for both casual and hardcore players. If you prefer a relaxing experience, you can focus on solving puzzles and collecting coins. But if you seek a real challenge, the game offers that too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/1102c38eaaae0f67abfc2b5a1bf08678.poster.avif?t=1772330747\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/1102c38eaaae0f67abfc2b5a1bf08678.webm?t=1772330747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/extras/1102c38eaaae0f67abfc2b5a1bf08678.mp4?t=1772330747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will Looppip manage to turn back time and save the future?</strong><br>In <i>Looppip</i>, every rewind is a chance to restore nature.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3254910?t=1772330747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/8e8f81681a24c07acd621394db4122a697c173a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772330747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/647b48904a990936bcfc1ee525fae11863c80cbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772330747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254910/647b48904a990936bcfc1ee525fae11863c80cbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772330747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3613840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com